# Rainfall Data

This project uses the Afghanistan subnational rainfall dataset from the Humanitarian Data Exchange (HDX):

- Source dataset: https://data.humdata.org/dataset/afg-rainfall-subnational
- File used: afg-rainfall-subnat-full.csv

The dataset contains rainfall records for Afghanistan at subnational administrative levels and is used in this project for rainfall forecasting and flood-risk analysis.

Notes:
- Data source: Humanitarian Data Exchange (OCHA / HDX)
- Geographic focus: Afghanistan
- Temporal coverage: depends on the downloaded file version provided by the source
- File format: CSV

If the CSV is not already included in the repository, download it from the HDX link above and place it in the project data folder before running the analysis scripts.
